- [README.md](README.md)
- [.instructions/INSTRUCTIONS_ATTACHMENTS.md](.instructions/INSTRUCTIONS_ATTACHMENTS.md)
- [tools/agents-infra/internal/attachments](tools/agents-infra/internal/attachments)

